"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5405130","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1377050-1847286114035808","game_id":"steam-1377050","kind":"update","title":"Knights of the Fall DEMO Gets Another Update","summary":"Hello, Knights! Our team has been hard at work improving the Knights of the Fall demo, tackling reported issues and refining performance to make your time with the game more enjoyable. Thank you for continuing to share your feedback, bug reports and gameplay recordings. They help us identify the areas that need attention, and this update brings another round of improvements based on your experiences. We’re continuing to work on fixes and improvements, so please keep the feedback coming. Thanks f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:16:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035808","verified_at":"2026-10-23T11:22:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1377050-1847286114031857","game_id":"steam-1377050","kind":"update","title":"Knights of the Fall DEMO Update Is Live!","summary":"Hello, Knights! Thank you so much for playing the Knights of the Fall DEMO and for all the feedback you've sent us. We've read every comment, bug report and suggestion, and we really appreciate how much detail you put into them. It helps us make the game better every day. This update is based on what you told us, so keep it coming! You'll find the full change log below. Change Log: Corrected the positioning of door interaction icons. Disabled entering doors while jumping to prevent floating char","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:19:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031857","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:54:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1377050-1846651706692050","game_id":"steam-1377050","kind":"announcement","title":"Enter the Apocalypse - Knights of the Fall Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"Hello, Knights! The world has fallen. Earth is stranded in another dimension. Armed with a katana and the ability to manipulate time and gravity, Haru must fight to find a way home. For the first time ever, the DEMO of Knights of the Fall is now publicly available on Steam as part of Steam Next Fest! But before you step into this apocalyptic world, ask yourself: Is your katana sharp enough, and can you master time and gravity to overcome the enemies lurking in the ruins? There’s only one way to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:07:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1377050-1810503566418231","game_id":"steam-1377050","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Knights of the Fall – A Sci-Fi Journey Beyond Dimensions","summary":"Hello everyone, We’re thrilled to finally introduce Knights of the Fall – a sci-fi 2D/3D hybrid platformer that follows the story of Haru, a combat veteran, and Yoshida, his scientist sidekick, as they uncover the dark connection between interdimensional travel and the afterlife. Armed with experimental technology, they’ll bend time and gravity to survive in a world forever changed. Just a few weeks ago, we had the honor of showcasing our very first trailer at Gamescom. Sharing the game with pla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-11T14:06:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566418231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:56Z","discovery_meth